@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor "Khách hàng" as Customer
actor "Nhân viên quầy" as Staff
actor "Cổng thanh toán" as Gateway
rectangle "HỆ THỐNG BREWLITE" {
  usecase "Đăng ký" as Register
  usecase "Đăng nhập" as Login
  usecase "Xem menu" as Menu
  usecase "Xem chi tiết sản phẩm" as Detail
  usecase "Chọn size/topping" as Options
  usecase "Quản lý giỏ hàng" as Cart
  usecase "Tạo đơn hàng" as Order
  usecase "Áp mã khuyến mãi" as Coupon
  usecase "Thanh toán không tiền mặt" as Payment
  usecase "Xem xác nhận đơn" as Confirm
  usecase "Xem lịch sử đơn" as History
  usecase "Tiếp nhận đơn" as Receive
  usecase "Cập nhật trạng thái pha chế" as Prepare
}
Customer -- Register
Customer -- Login
Customer -- Menu
Customer -- Detail
Customer -- Cart
Customer -- Order
Customer -- History
Staff -- Login
Staff -- Receive
Staff -- Prepare
Gateway -- Payment
Options ..> Detail : <<extend>>
Order ..> Login : <<include>>
Coupon ..> Order : <<extend>>
Order ..> Payment : <<include>>
Payment ..> Confirm : <<include>>
@enduml
